  <name>Lune</name>
  <summary>Fast, gapless music player for your library</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.fritojay">
    <name>fritojay</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Lune plays a local music library (M4A, MP3, FLAC, and more) with
      gapless playback. It browses by album artist, artist, album, or year,
      searches as you type, and keeps a play queue separate from what you browse.
    </p>
    <p>
      Library folders are watched, so new and changed files appear on their own.
      Music files are only ever read, never modified.
    </p>
  </description>
